      \hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s3\sl365 {\*\bkmkstart ID_types_45_lifetime_45_caller}{\*\bkmkend ID_types_45_lifetime_45_caller}\b\fs28\f1 4.13.4 Caller Lifetime (#)\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 Values that must survive a function return use caller lifetime. The value is allocated on the caller's page, not the function's local page:\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl257 \fs19\lang1024\f2 \sa0\par\fi0\sb0
