      \hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl286 \fs22\lang1033\f0 The compiler infers thrown lifetime for values in throw position.\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\s3\sl365 {\*\bkmkstart ID_types_45_lifetime_45_reference}{\*\bkmkend ID_types_45_lifetime_45_reference}\b\fs28\lang1024\f1 4.13.6 Reference Lifetime (^name)\keepn\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb165\sl286 \b0\fs22\lang1033\f0 When adding a value to a collection, the value must be allocated on the same page as the collection. Use reference lifetime with the collection's name:\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl257 \fs19\lang1024\f2 \sa0\par\fi0\sb0
