      \hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl286 \b\fs22\lang1033\f0 Validation:\b0  The compiler verifies that the referenced variable (\f2 items\f0  in this example) is page-allocated. Referencing a stack-allocated variable is an error:\hyphpar0\par\pard\sb330\sl257 \fs19\lang1024\f2 \sa0\par\fi0\sb0
